WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.388
Kip was standing on his head.

2
00:00:04.389 --> 00:00:07.005
"Ha-ha!" Bird laughed.

3
00:00:07.006 --> 00:00:09.690
"You're very silly, Kip."

4
00:00:09.691 --> 00:00:13.548
"And I'm standing on my head," said Kip.

5
00:00:13.549 --> 00:00:16.426
"Soon I'll be very good at it."

6
00:00:16.427 --> 00:00:22.088
"You're doing great," said Bird.

7
00:00:22.089 --> 00:00:25.727
"You're very good at standing on your head."

8
00:00:25.728 --> 00:00:29.859
"I think I'll do this all day long," said Kip.

9
00:00:29.860 --> 00:00:35.282
Just then a ladybug flew by.

10
00:00:35.283 --> 00:00:42.043
It flew all around.

11
00:00:42.044 --> 00:00:45.278
Then it landed on Kip's foot.

12
00:00:45.279 --> 00:00:50.860
It walked across his toes.

13
00:00:50.861 --> 00:00:53.631
"Hey!" Kip laughed.

14
00:00:53.632 --> 00:01:10.024
"Ha-ha! That tickles!"

15
00:01:10.025 --> 00:01:14.586
Kip started to lose his balance.

16
00:01:14.587 --> 00:01:23.958
"Uh-oh!" he said. "I'm going to fall!"

17
00:01:23.959 --> 00:01:28.828
Boom!

18
00:01:28.829 --> 00:01:34.046
"Kip, are you okay?" asked Bird.

19
00:01:34.047 --> 00:01:37.263
"I'm not hurt," said Kip.

20
00:01:37.264 --> 00:01:40.886
"But I'm not happy anymore."

21
00:01:40.887 --> 00:01:43.808
"Why not?" asked Bird.

22
00:01:43.809 --> 00:01:49.714
"Because I fell down," said Kip.

23
00:01:49.715 --> 00:01:59.129
"I didn't stand on my head all day long.

24
00:01:59.130 --> 00:02:03.010
So I'm not very good at it!"

